              version="1.7">
        <doc xml:space="preserve"
             filename="libgcab/gcab-cabinet.c"
             line="1204">Set the next cabinet in a multi-cabinet set.  When set, extraction
of files that span into the next cabinet (CONTINUED_TO_NEXT) will
automatically continue reading data from @next.

The reference is weak: @next is not kept alive by @cabinet.</doc>
        <source-position filename="libgcab/gcab-cabinet.h" line="123"/>
